@page "/settings/backup"

@*
    Google Drive backup, laid out the way WhatsApp's chat backup is, because that is the
    backup screen most people already know: when the last one was, one Back up button, and
    the few choices under it.

    Not built yet (S12), and the page says so rather than pretending. Everything is shown so
    the shape is familiar, and everything is greyed out. Until it exists, the JSON export in
    Settings > Backup and Restore is the way to keep a copy.
*@

<PageTitle>Google Drive backup</PageTitle>

<h1>Google Drive backup</h1>

<div class="drive-soon" role="status">
    <strong>Coming soon.</strong> Until then, use Export to a file in Settings.
</div>

<div class="card drive-hero coming-soon" aria-disabled="true">
    <span class="drive-cloud" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 18.5h10.2a4 4 0 0 0 .6-7.96A5.6 5.6 0 0 0 6.9 9.6 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 7 18.5Z" />
            <path d="M12 15.5v-5M9.8 12.6 12 10.4l2.2 2.2" />
        </svg>
    </span>
    <h2 class="drive-heading">Last backup</h2>
    <dl class="drive-facts">
        <dt>Google Drive</dt>
        <dd>Never</dd>
        <dt>Size</dt>
        <dd>-</dd>
    </dl>
    <p class="muted small">
        Back up your containers, transactions, labels, contacts, plans and goals to your own
        Google Drive. Restore them on a new phone or after reinstalling EleFi.
    </p>
    <p class="muted small">
        Encrypted on this phone before it leaves, so Google holds something it cannot read.
    </p>
    <button type="button" class="primary drive-back-up" disabled>Back up</button>
</div>

<div class="card settings-list coming-soon" aria-disabled="true">
    <div class="settings-row drive-row">
        <span class="settings-text">
            <span class="settings-title">Google Account</span>
            <span class="settings-sub">None chosen</span>
        </span>
    </div>
    <div class="settings-row drive-row">
        <span class="settings-text">
            <span class="settings-title">Back up to Google Drive</span>
            <span class="settings-sub">Never</span>
        </span>
    </div>
    <div class="settings-row drive-row">
        <span class="settings-text">
            <span class="settings-title">Back up using mobile data</span>
        </span>
        <label class="switch">
            <input type="checkbox" aria-label="Back up using mobile data" disabled />
            <span class="track"></span>
        </label>
    </div>
    <div class="settings-row drive-row">
        <span class="settings-text">
            <span class="settings-title">Encrypted backup</span>
            <span class="settings-sub">Always on</span>
        </span>
    </div>
</div>
